---
description: Forbid raw HTML and raw React Native primitives in Janus app source
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not write lowercase HTML (`<h1>`, `<div>`) or import `View`/`Text`/`Pressable`/`TextInput` from `react-native` in app source. Use `@janus/primitives` (`H1`, `Div`, `Button`, `Input`). Autofix: `<h1>` → `<H1>` plus the Janus import.
